1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,560
Brother Wang,

25
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,320
the teams we sent to the other countries are gradually returning.

26
00:02:03,870 --> 00:02:06,120
This war was prepared meticulously.

27
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:08,960
It was beyond our imagination.

28
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:12,560
We asked eight rank 4 cultivations countries for help,

29
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:14,960
but almost all of them refused.

30
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:18,800
Even when our envoys were recieved,

31
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:22,160
they did not agree to send any troops.

32
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,920
Only a country which has been a friend for generations,

33
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:27,520
told us out of sympathy,

34
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:30,480
that their ancestors had made a deal

35
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:34,080
and issued the order that no one is to help the Four Sect Alliance

36
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:36,720
How can Xue Yue, a rank 4 country,

37
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:39,200
have such an influence ?

38
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:43,600
The real reason for this war is actually

39
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,520
a woman from Xue Yue.

40
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:47,960
This woman

41
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,840
has only cultivated 100 years.

42
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,400
She has never consumed any pill,

43
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,880
and already has reached Soul Formation.

44
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:56,600
It's rumored that

45
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:59,560
she has a never seen before 5 elements constitution.

46
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:02,440
She was born with 5 elemental spirits guarding her.

47
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:03,880
Now she controls them.

48
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:07,680
She is the most talented person born on Suzaku in the past 10 000 years.

49
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,800
This woman,

50
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,490
has attracted the attention of the rank 6 country of Suzaku

51
00:03:12,540 --> 00:03:15,680
which invited her to join them to rule the planet.

52
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:19,960
She only set a single condition to her joining Suzaku.

53
00:03:20,890 --> 00:03:23,960
Which is to raise Xue Yue to a rank 5 country

54
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:26,280
and have them leave

55
00:03:26,290 --> 00:03:27,880
the barren North.

56
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,480
The place she chose,

57
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:33,280
was the Four Sect Alliance.

58
00:03:32,630 --> 00:03:34,660
Four Sect Alliance

59
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:35,080
On top of that,

60
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,800
The Rain Cauldron of Xue Yue

61
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:40,360
suddenly appeared in the Four Sect Alliance.

62
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,560
There will be

63
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:45,120
many powerful Soul Formation cultivators in this war.

64
00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:46,560
My cultivation is still limited.

65
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:49,000
If I really need to fight them

66
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,680
my only chance is to place one last restriction on this flag

67
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:55,080
to summon a tribulation.

68
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:03,480
1 year later

69
00:04:08,170 --> 00:04:09,680
Within 80 feet of the Sky-Locking Nail,

70
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:11,020
using artifacts is forbidden.

71
00:04:11,050 --> 00:04:11,660
Pay attention !

72
00:04:11,490 --> 00:04:12,530
By order of the sect leader,

73
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,450
take the Green Jade Bell of the Water Ink Sect,

74
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:15,990
and use it as the center of the formation.

75
00:04:16,020 --> 00:04:16,800
Fellow cultivators,

76
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,010
build the formation with me.

77
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:19,080
Yes !

78
00:04:22,610 --> 00:04:23,200
Master,

79
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:24,680
the dragon soul is in place.

80
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:26,360
It can be woken up at any time.

81
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,450
They have arrived.

82
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,400
Fellow cultivators of Xue Yue,

83
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:57,720
since you are here for the Rain Cauldron,

84
00:04:58,400 --> 00:04:59,920
it's right here.

85
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:03,230
Can our two countries call a truce

86
00:05:03,690 --> 00:05:04,960
and let the mortals

87
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:06,720
survive ?

88
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:07,480
Kill !

89
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:08,320
Kill !

90
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,120
Kill !

91
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,160
This land

92
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:11,760
now belongs to Xue Yue.

93
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:13,200
The Rain Cauldron

94
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:15,000
also belongs to Xue Yue.

95
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:16,720
The mortals

96
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,280
will also belong to Xue Yue if they survive.

97
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:20,920
Kill them now.

98
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,280
This land

99
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:24,960
is our new Xue Yue.

100
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:02,640
The cultivators of Xue Yue use this snow for their spells.

101
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:05,320
It snowed for many years...

102
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,360
so that's why.

103
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,340
Humans

104
00:06:09,490 --> 00:06:10,880
cannot live without a home,

105
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,040
and we, cultivators,

106
00:06:13,070 --> 00:06:14,360
are also human.

107
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,280
If we want to save our homeland,

108
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,000
then today,

109
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,960
we will fight to the death !

110
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,040
Mo Shan\NWater Ink Sect Elder\NMiddle stage Soul Formation

111
00:06:30,350 --> 00:06:31,040
Wu Huichu\NBlack Soul Sect Elder\NLate stage Soul Formation

112
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:41,000
The five elemental spirits ?

113
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:42,120
Go !

114
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:56,360
I heard that the five elemental spirits are all Soul Formation.

115
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:59,480
Today, I finally meet them.

116
00:06:56,670 --> 00:06:59,680
Qing Fu\NGreen Wood Sect Elder,\NMiddle stage Soul Formation

117
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,920
Both sides are still preserving their power.

118
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:07,720
The Ice Towers !

119
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,880
That means Soul Formation elders have arrived

120
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:15,440
36 Soul Formation cultivators...

121
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:18,000
4 of them are Late stage.

122
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:21,160
Xue Yue sent all of their elders on this battlefield...

123
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:59,080
Zhou Yun\NBlack Soul Sect Great Elder\NLate stage Soul Formation

124
00:08:56,200 --> 00:09:00,040
I am the Black Soul Sect's Zhou Yun

125
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:04,640
May I ask if you are Xue Yue's Red Butterfly ?

126
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:09,080
So it's fellow cultivator Zhou Yun,

127
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:12,720
one of the nine Late stage Soul Formation of the Four Sect Alliance

128
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,040
I admire you.

129
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:19,840
The Nine-Sons killing formation is very powerful,

130
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:23,400
it can definitely kill anyone below Soul Transformation

131
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:25,160
Although this formation is strong

132
00:09:25,670 --> 00:09:28,590
It will consume the lifespan of Seniors.

133
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:30,880
If we lose our country,

134
00:09:30,900 --> 00:09:32,000
our sects

135
00:09:32,170 --> 00:09:33,410
and our lives.

136
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:36,680
What's the point of having preserved our lifespan ?

137
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:40,640
The key to this battle is Red Butterfly.

138
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:42,560
Once this woman dies,

139
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:45,880
Xue Yue will lose the support of the country of Suzaku.

140
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:48,920
Then we will have a chance to win the war.

141
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:53,760
Xue Yue could not have overlooked this strategy of yours.

142
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,400
There might be dozens

143
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:57,320
of Soul Formation cultivators

144
00:09:57,350 --> 00:09:59,320
laying in ambush around Red Butterfly.

145
00:09:59,330 --> 00:10:00,840
to save her no matter what.

146
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,360
What should we do ?

147
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:05,520
We need to force their Soul Formation cultivators

148
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:08,160
to put all their efforts into the battlefield.

149
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,520
No matter what it takes.

150
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,920
Fellow cultivators,

151
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:13,960
let's fight !

152
00:10:21,560 --> 00:10:22,720
Lifespan sacrifice !

153
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:29,320
Burning away your lifespans ?

154
00:10:29,340 --> 00:10:30,240
Futile.

155
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:42,000
The damage is spread out ?

156
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:46,160
Nine-Sons killing formation !

157
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,120
Rise !

158
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,360
Our combined strength,

159
00:10:55,380 --> 00:10:56,680
can kill you !

160
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:37,720
They killed Red Butterfly ?

161
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:40,920
This seemed too easy to be real.

162
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,680
Red Butterfly is dead !

163
00:11:50,870 --> 00:11:53,760
The Four Sect Alliance will not give up its land !

164
00:11:53,790 --> 00:11:55,320
We won't give up our land !

165
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:57,600
Kill them !

166
00:12:32,210 --> 00:12:34,560
Guardian Azure Dragon,

167
00:12:34,580 --> 00:12:37,160
protect our Four Sect Alliance !

168
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:40,240
So the reason his status is so high

169
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:42,800
despite only being Nascent Soul

170
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,680
is because he has the bloodline

171
00:12:44,710 --> 00:12:46,000
of the Guardian Azure Dragon.

172
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:48,680
Red Butterfly is dead,

173
00:12:48,740 --> 00:12:50,270
the five elemental spirits are weakened.

174
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:52,720
My fellow cultivators, do your best to fight !

175
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:55,560
Do not let that tiger escape !

176
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,160
Seal !

177
00:13:40,650 --> 00:13:42,970
The elements of the Heaven Defying Bead are incomplete.

178
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:45,760
Maybe I can absorb this Soul Formation earth spirit.

179
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,760
It's worth trying.

180
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,920
Where can you escape to ?

181
00:14:44,860 --> 00:14:45,480
Well,

182
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:48,120
even if the earth spirit is injured,

183
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,760
I cannot underestimate its strength.

184
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:53,480
Evil beast !

185
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:13,720
Bold of you !

186
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:17,140
Junior is a disciple of the White Cloud Sect

187
00:15:17,190 --> 00:15:18,480
I am Qing Song's disciple.

188
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:20,840
My master ordered me to take the earth spirit.

189
00:15:21,680 --> 00:15:22,800
Senior, don't blame me.

190
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,120
It's really Qing Song's passage of time domain.

191
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,440
White Cloud Sect !

192
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,590
If that Soul Formation cultivator were to act,

193
00:15:36,640 --> 00:15:37,880
I would be dead without a doubt.

194
00:15:39,760 --> 00:15:40,920
The restriction flag was damaged.

195
00:15:42,040 --> 00:15:43,480
Snatching food from the tiger's mouth

196
00:15:44,290 --> 00:15:45,400
is too risky.

197
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,640
What's this ?

198
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:24,280
This ice sculpture is almost impossible to detect with Divine Sense.

199
00:16:24,690 --> 00:16:27,010
It seems that even the Soul Formation cultivators

200
00:16:27,520 --> 00:16:29,000
did not notice it.

201
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:32,400
The power of ice contained in it is tremendous

202
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:35,080
It must be a part of a formation.

203
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:45,800
This ice formation covers the whole Four Sect Alliance.

204
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:48,120
This war

205
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:50,920
is far from over.

206
00:16:54,280 --> 00:16:55,640
A gigantic ice formation ?

207
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:03,560
This is...

208
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:04,600
a formation ?

209
00:17:04,760 --> 00:17:06,720
Xue Yue came well prepared...

210
00:17:06,800 --> 00:17:07,680
Everyone, be careful !

211
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:30,860
This is bad...

212
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:44,450
Lord Envoy,

213
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:47,840
the country of Suzaku promised

214
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:50,600
that they would help me once.

215
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:52,080
So now...

216
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:56,160
Please kill this Azure Dragon !

217
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:59,160
Red Butterfly\NXue Yue's genius Dao Child\NPeak Late stage Soul Formation

218
00:18:14,280 --> 00:18:18,160
I've had my share of wounds,\Nnow I want to fight back.

219
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:21,720
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

220
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:27,640
that's blocking all my hopes,\Nfor life ?

221
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:33,400
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,\Nmy adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

222
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:36,800
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

223
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:42,800
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer\Nout of reach.

224
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:48,280
Immortals\Nare obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

225
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:52,320
Renegades\Nseek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

226
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:56,160
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself\Nand that the path to revenge leads to hell

227
00:18:56,400 --> 00:19:00,280
because I don't see the harm in that.

228
00:19:02,280 --> 00:19:08,080
My new body opens its eyes\Nand awakens from its dream.

229
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:15,640
I have overcome many trials\Nto get this body back.

230
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:23,280
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,\NI can still see.

231
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:32,640
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done\Nby my own hands.

232
00:20:03,520 --> 00:20:09,480
Returning to my body opened my eyes,\NI need to continue my Immortal journey.

233
00:20:09,640 --> 00:20:17,040
With a flick of a finger,\Nonly my indomitable heart remains.

234
00:20:17,080 --> 00:20:26,440
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.\NEven if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

235
00:20:26,760 --> 00:20:34,280
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,\Nlike the descent of a god.
